      "deletions": 3,
      "filename": "chapters/descriptor_heap.adoc",
      "patch": "@@ -357,8 +357,8 @@ A `Shader Record` refers to an entry in the link:https://docs.vulkan.org/spec/la\n The mappings work the exact same, just instead of mapping to a descriptor, such as a buffer/image/accelerationStructure, it maps to a shader record.\n \n - `VK_DESCRIPTOR_MAPPING_SOURCE_HEAP_WITH_SHADER_RECORD_INDEX_EXT` works just like `VK_DESCRIPTOR_MAPPING_SOURCE_HEAP_WITH_PUSH_INDEX_EXT`\n-- `VK_DESCRIPTOR_MAPPING_SOURCE_SHADER_RECORD_DATA_EXT` works just like `VK_DESCRIPTOR_MAPPING_SOURCE_PUSH_ADDRESS_EXT`\n-- `VK_DESCRIPTOR_MAPPING_SOURCE_SHADER_RECORD_ADDRESS_EXT` works just like `VK_DESCRIPTOR_MAPPING_SOURCE_INDIRECT_ADDRESS_EXT`\n+- `VK_DESCRIPTOR_MAPPING_SOURCE_SHADER_RECORD_DATA_EXT` works just like `VK_DESCRIPTOR_MAPPING_SOURCE_PUSH_DATA_EXT`\n+- `VK_DESCRIPTOR_MAPPING_SOURCE_SHADER_RECORD_ADDRESS_EXT` works just like `VK_DESCRIPTOR_MAPPING_SOURCE_PUSH_ADDRESS_EXT`\n \n === VkDescriptorMappingSourceEXT bindingCount alias\n \n@@ -603,7 +603,7 @@ VkDescriptorMappingSourcePushIndexEXT::pushOffset = 0;\n VkDescriptorMappingSourcePushIndexEXT::samplerPushOffset = 4;\n \n vkCmdPushDataEXT(offset = 0, size = 4, value = 6); // image offset to 6\n-vkCmdPushDataEXT(offset = 0, size = 4, value = 7); // sampler offset to 7\n+vkCmdPushDataEXT(offset = 4, size = 4, value = 7); // sampler offset to 7\n ----\n \n you now can pack it into a single 32-bit word.",
      "raw_url": "https://github.com/hiruniramanayaka1/vulkan-guide/raw/82887e8444045655cc4578827e4183be9de593ff/chapters%2Fdescriptor_heap.adoc",
